{{fbdoc item="title" value="Compiler Option: -v"}}----
Be verbose

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	**-v**
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	The ##-v## compiler option activates verbose mode. In this mode the compiler shows its actions step by step. The intrinsic define ##[[KeyPgDdfbverbose|__FB_VERBOSE__]]## is non-zero while verbose mode is active.

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerCmdLine|Using the Command Line]]

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgCompOpt|Compiler Options"}}
